          "url": "https://github.com/qaml-ai/camelAI/blob/5f3c295d66fd3fe3d70069aa56a394faf75814d5/README.md#L103-L106"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0b29593fa81365d32681e231f8bcdc86bc80fa49fc5e296330bbe57dcfdb8810"
      ],
      "text": "The agent harness is camelAI's own, built from pi's lower-level agent-loop and state-management libraries; Anthropic, OpenAI, OpenRouter, Bedrock, and custom endpoints supply only the model, not the harness."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7225ccde0f524d2c7ff44ad39db83e362d44a93fa272cc000388deffca84cc8a",
