        "slc_ef0969727cbf62f3175a5725f5415cebf2300f5c0539dc21bb3164e76d0549fe"
      ],
      "text": "Linux sandbox containers are reserved for short-lived jobs (app builds, notebook analysis, SQL queries); project deploys flow through a build sandbox to Workers for Platforms, and a dispatcher Worker routes requests to published apps."
    },
